title: Party Organizations
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: party_organizations_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; party_organizations_timer = 6;
card-image: img/Mann_der_Arbeit.jpg
max-visits: 12

= Party Organizations

Beyond electoral politics, the coalition is a whole social and organizational world - mutual aid networks, independent media, local chapters, and canvassing infrastructure.

- @media_org: Fund independent media and messaging.
- @welfare: Fund mutual aid programs.
- @culture: Fund community, educational, and cultural programs.
- @canvass: Fund the canvass network, our organizing infrastructure.
- @youth: We have a reputation as a party of the old guard. Support youth organizing.
- @nothing: Do not increase funding for any program.
- @easy_discard

@media_org
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; media_timer = 0;
go-to: media

@welfare
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; working_class_dem += 3*(1-dissent); working_class_dem += 3*(1-dissent) if crisis_urgency >= 1;

We have increased funding to mutual aid programs. [? if crisis_urgency >= 1 : In a moment of economic crisis, this is especially valuable for building trust among those hit hardest. ?]

@culture
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; insurgent_dissent -= 6; progressive_dissent -= 6; labor_left_dissent -= 6; establishment_dem_dissent -= 6; blue_dog_dissent -= 6

It is not enough to only be a political operation. Community organizations, mutual aid networks, and cultural programming are crucial to keeping members engaged even when specific policy fights don't go our way.

[? if online_right_strength >= 400 : It can feel frivolous to spend on cultural programming when the online right is organizing harassment campaigns against our members. ?]

@canvass
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; canvass_strength += 5; canvass_militancy += 0.01; canvassing_timer = 0;

We have invested in expanding our canvass network.

@youth
choose-if: resources > 0
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
subtitle: -1 resources
on-arrival: resources -= 1; canvass_strength += 3; canvass_militancy += 0.02; insurgent_strength += 5; radicalization += 1;

Our new young members flock disproportionately to the insurgent wing, and bring fresh energy to the canvass network.

@nothing

We do not fund any party organizations this month.

- @return: Continue...
